WEBVTT

00:00:03.022 --> 00:00:03.711
1

00:00:04.822 --> 00:00:06.747
I’m <b>doing</b> my homework.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.924
Do you always <b>do</b> your homework?

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:12.435
2

00:00:13.422 --> 00:00:14.871
<b>Do</b> you speak English?

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:17.026
Where <b>do</b> they live?

00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:19.182
They <b>don’t</b> have children.

00:00:20.177 --> 00:00:21.914
<b>Does</b> your sister have a car?

00:00:22.844 --> 00:00:24.381
Where <b>does</b> your father work?

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:27.088
Alan <b>doesn’t</b> like jazz.